                      [32mPKGBUILD [PKGBUILD ...][0m

.TP
\fBPKGBUILD\fR
One or more packages to build (path, directory, or bare package name).

.SH OPTIONS \fI\,'sysforge build'\/\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-makepkg\fR \fI\,FLAGS\/\fR, \fB\-m\fR \fI\,FLAGS\/\fR
Additional makepkg flags, appended after profile makepkg_flags. Combined short flags are expanded: \-sfci becomes \-s
\-f \-c \-i. Example: sysforge build PKGBUILD \-m '\-sfci'

.TP
\fB\-\-interactive\fR
Strip \-\-noconfirm from profile makepkg_flags.

.TP
\fB\-\-persist\-log\fR
Keep the per\-package log file after a successful build.

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pkg\-log\fR
Disable the per\-package log file.

.TP
\fB\-\-log\-dir\fR \fI\,DIR\/\fR
Directory for the per\-package log file (default: alongside the PKGBUILD).

.TP
\fB\-\-profile\-conf\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR
Path to a profiles.toml to use instead of the default.

.TP
\fB\-\-cc\fR \fI\,COMPILER\/\fR
Override CC (C compiler) for this build, e.g. \-\-cc clang.

.TP
\fB\-\-cxx\fR \fI\,COMPILER\/\fR
Override CXX (C++ compiler) for this build, e.g. \-\-cxx clang++.

.TP
\fB\-\-ld\fR \fI\,LINKER\/\fR
Override linker for this build, e.g. \-\-ld lld.

.TP
\fB\-\-cache\-report\fR
Print a structured cache summary (ccache/sccache hit rates) after the build.

.TP
\fB\-\-abi\-check\fR
Run a post\-build ABI compatibility check on built shared libraries.

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-update\fR
Skip git pull \-\-rebase before building.

.TP
\fB\-\-cleansrc\fR
Purge the package src dir and re\-clone before building. Refuses (per package) if the existing clone has uncommitted
changes, unpushed commits, or no upstream tracking branch.

.TP
\fB\-\-state\-dir\fR \fI\,DIR\/\fR
Override state directory for build_state.toml.

